
% Touch

a: ii | IV | vi | V |
a_turnaround: IV | ii III | vi I | II |
In: $a*2 $a_turnaround
Vr_a: $a*2 $a_turnaround
b: ii | V | iii vi |
c: IV | V | iii vi |
instr_b: $b*4
instr_c: $c*2
Vr_c: $c*3
Vr_c_longer: $c*5
filtersweep: R |
cc: IV | V | iii | vi |
instr_cc: $cc*4
instr_cc_longer: $cc*10
S: [A] $In $Vr_a $instr_b $instr_b $instr_c $Vr_c $Vr_c_longer $filtersweep $instr_cc $instr_cc_longer $Vr_a
